DO $cookies$
DECLARE
 j constant jsonb := $records$[{"id":"8e3b0f6a-5263-420c-b665-3889ab1358e6","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate","public_path":"/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/","language":"es","title":"Galletas de avena y chocolate negro","excerpt":"Galletas caseras con copos de avena y chocolate: ingredientes pesados, masa refrigerada, dos tandas y nutrición estimada por unidad.","summary":"Galletas con copos de avena enteros y trocitos de chocolate negro, preparadas con mantequilla cremosa y masa refrigerada. Se proponen 20 unidades y 118 minutos con atemperado, dos tandas de horno y enfriado; fórmula y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.","category":"Postres","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Postre","cuisine":"Casera","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"copos de avena sin azúcar, no instantáneos","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Secos y chocolate"},{"name":"harina de trigo común, no leudante","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Secos y chocolate"},{"name":"mantequilla sin sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla cremosa"},{"name":"azúcar moreno","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla cremosa"},{"name":"azúcar blanco granulado","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla cremosa"},{"name":"huevo entero sin cáscara, pesado","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla cremosa"},{"name":"extracto de vainilla","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Mezcla cremosa"},{"name":"polvo de hornear de doble acción","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Secos y chocolate"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Secos y chocolate"},{"name":"chocolate negro 60–69 %, en trocitos","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Secos y chocolate"}],"steps":[{"title":"Atempera la mantequilla y prepara los utensilios","content":"Corta los 100 g de mantequilla sin sal en dados y déjalos unos 20 minutos a temperatura ambiente hasta que cedan a la presión sin estar derretidos; si siguen duros, amplía este tiempo. Prepara báscula, dos cuencos, espátula, batidor y dos bandejas metálicas de unos 40 ×30 cm con papel de horno. Pesa los demás ingredientes; los 50 g de huevo se pesan sin cáscara y no equivalen necesariamente a un huevo entero. Mantén el huevo frío hasta incorporarlo.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Atempera la mantequilla y prepara los utensilios"},{"title":"Bate la mantequilla con los dos azúcares","content":"Bate la mantequilla blanda con los 100 g de azúcar moreno y los 40 g de azúcar blanco durante unos 2 minutos, hasta lograr una pasta cremosa uniforme. Raspa el fondo y los laterales para que no queden dados de mantequilla. No derritas la mantequilla ni intentes disolver todos los granos de azúcar; su textura puede seguir ligeramente granulosa.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Bate la mantequilla con los dos azúcares"},{"title":"Añade el huevo y la vainilla","content":"Incorpora los 50 g de huevo sin cáscara y los 4 g de extracto de vainilla. Bate aproximadamente 1 minuto hasta integrar, raspando de nuevo el cuenco. Si la mezcla parece algo separada, continúa con los secos en el siguiente paso. Lava manos y utensilios que hayan tocado huevo crudo; no pruebes esta mezcla.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Añade el huevo y la vainilla"},{"title":"Mezcla e incorpora la harina","content":"En el segundo cuenco mezcla los 120 g de harina, los 4 g de polvo de hornear y el 1 g de sal hasta repartirlos. Añade estos secos a la mezcla cremosa y remueve con espátula solo hasta que desaparezca la harina visible. No uses harina leudante ni prolongues el batido: la masa debe quedar espesa, sin bolsas de polvo.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Mezcla e incorpora la harina"},{"title":"Agrega los copos y el chocolate","content":"Añade los 150 g de copos de avena y los 100 g de chocolate troceado. Mezcla desde el fondo con la espátula para distribuirlos; la avena debe mantenerse en copos, no triturarse. La masa queda firme y pegajosa. No añadas leche ni agua y no pruebes la masa cruda, porque contiene harina y huevo sin cocinar.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Agrega los copos y el chocolate"},{"title":"Enfría la masa y precalienta el horno","content":"Tapa el cuenco y refrigera la masa durante 30 minutos a 4 °C o menos para que se afirme. Durante los últimos 15 minutos de este enfriado, precalienta el horno a 180 °C con calor arriba y abajo y rejilla central. El precalentamiento se solapa con el frío; no se suma otra vez al tiempo total. Mantén la segunda tanda refrigerada mientras se hornea la primera.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Enfría la masa y precalienta el horno"},{"title":"Forma veinte porciones iguales","content":"Divide toda la masa en 20 porciones iguales de unos 33–34 g; la suma de ingredientes es 669 g antes de cocinar. Forma bolas y aplástalas ligeramente hasta discos de unos 4 cm de diámetro y 1 cm de grosor. Coloca 10 en cada bandeja, dejando unos 5 cm entre sus bordes; usa las dos bandejas frías. Si la distribución no cabe en tu bandeja, haz más tandas y amplía el tiempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Forma veinte porciones iguales"},{"title":"Hornea una bandeja cada vez","content":"Hornea la primera bandeja en el centro a 180 °C durante 14 minutos como referencia; empieza a revisar a los 12 y prevé unos 12–16 según horno. Los bordes deben verse dorados y el centro asentado, sin masa húmeda brillante; un centro algo flexible al sacarlas se afirma al enfriarse. Si falta cocción, añade 2 minutos y vuelve a revisar. Retira con guantes secos y hornea la segunda bandeja del mismo modo. Las dos tandas de referencia suman 28 minutos de horno.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Hornea una bandeja cada vez"},{"title":"Enfría en rejilla y guarda cuando estén frías","content":"Deja cada tanda 5 minutos en su bandeja y después pásala con espátula a una rejilla durante unos 15 minutos más. El enfriado de la primera tanda se solapa con el segundo horneado; se cuentan 20 minutos después de la última tanda. El total propuesto es 118 minutos: 20 de atemperado +20 de preparación activa +30 de frío +28 de horno +20 de enfriado final. Sirve una galleta por ración, con rendimiento propuesto de 20 y sin peso final medido.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Galletas de avena y chocolate: Enfría en rejilla y guarda cuando estén frías"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"copos de avena sin azúcar, no instantáneos","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"harina de trigo común","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"mantequilla sin sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"azúcar moreno","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"azúcar blanco","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huevo entero sin cáscara","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"extracto de vainilla","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"polvo de hornear de doble acción","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fina","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"chocolate negro 60–69 %","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Una galleta de veinte iguales propuestas; sin peso final medido","method":"Suma gramos de cada uno de los diez ingredientes por su valor USDA por 100 g y divide el total entre 20. Se incluye toda la mantequilla, azúcar, huevo, avena y chocolate; no se inventan pérdidas de nutrientes al hornear.","note":"Estimación por ingredientes, no análisis ni ensayo de cocina. Avena seca regular no fortificada como referencia de copos; harina blanca enriquecida no blanqueada como referencia de harina común. Chocolate 60–69 % y polvo de hornear de doble acción pueden variar por marca, especialmente azúcar y sodio. Ajusta al rendimiento real si salen más o menos galletas. Los ocho nutrientes están presentes en las diez fichas; ninguna ausencia se rellena con cero."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Galletas doradas de avena con copos visibles y trocitos de chocolate negro sobre una rejilla, sin glaseado"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["galletas de avena y chocolate","galletas de copos de avena","galletas de chocolate negro","galletas caseras"],"notes":"Fórmula original propuesta, sin prueba de cocina: cantidades, rendimiento de 20 unidades, textura y tiempos pendientes de confirmación. Usa copos de avena naturales, harina común y mantequilla blanda sin derretir. Los 20 minutos de atemperado se amplían si la mantequilla sigue dura; el precalentamiento se solapa con el frío. Dos tandas de referencia y enfriado final se incluyen en el total; bandejas más pequeñas añaden tandas y tiempo. Puedes usar chocolate del mismo porcentaje en chispas o trocitos; chocolate con leche cambia la nutrición y los alérgenos. Cambiar mantequilla por aceite, harina integral o sin gluten o quitar huevo requiere reformular; no prometemos equivalencia. No pruebes harina, huevo ni masa crudos y limpia manos, superficies y utensilios después de manipularlos. Guarda las galletas completamente frías en recipiente limpio y hermético; consume en 3 días en un lugar fresco y seco como propuesta doméstica de calidad sin ensayo de conservación. Con calor o humedad, refrigera a 4 °C o menos. Para más tiempo, congela frías y bien envueltas hasta 1 mes como propuesta de calidad no verificada. Descarta toda la galleta si aparece moho. Contiene trigo/gluten, huevo y leche; revisa etiquetas de avena y chocolate por posibles trazas. Las cifras estimadas incluyen toda la fórmula y una unidad de veinte iguales.","seo":{"title":"Galletas de avena y chocolate paso a paso","description":"Prepara galletas con copos de avena y chocolate negro: cantidades pesadas, frío de la masa, horneado por tandas y nutrición estimada por unidad.","image_alt":"Galletas doradas de avena con copos visibles y trocitos de chocolate negro sobre una rejilla, sin glaseado","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Qué avena y chocolate uso?","a":"Usa 150 g de copos de avena naturales, no instantáneos azucarados, y 100 g de chocolate negro 60–69 %. Mantén los copos enteros. Chocolate de otro porcentaje o cereales preparados cambian la fórmula y la nutrición."},{"q":"¿Por qué debo enfriar la masa?","a":"Los 30 minutos a 4 °C o menos ayudan a afirmar la mantequilla y facilitan formar 20 discos iguales. No omitas el frío ni uses mantequilla derretida. Mantén refrigerada la segunda bandeja y no pruebes masa cruda."},{"q":"¿Cuánto tardan y cómo las conservo?","a":"Se proponen 118 minutos con 20 de atemperado, 20 de preparación, 30 de frío, 28 de horno en dos tandas y 20 de enfriado final. Empieza a comprobar cada tanda desde los 12 minutos a 180 °C. Guarda totalmente frías y consume en 3 días como propuesta sin ensayo; con calor o humedad, refrigera a 4 °C o menos."}]},"content_html":"<p>Galletas con copos de avena enteros y trocitos de chocolate negro, preparadas con mantequilla cremosa y masa refrigerada. Se proponen 20 unidades y 118 minutos con atemperado, dos tandas de horno y enfriado; fórmula y rendimiento pendientes de prueba de cocina.</p><p>Fórmula original propuesta, sin prueba de cocina: cantidades, rendimiento de 20 unidades, textura y tiempos pendientes de confirmación. Usa copos de avena naturales, harina común y mantequilla blanda sin derretir. Los 20 minutos de atemperado se amplían si la mantequilla sigue dura; el precalentamiento se solapa con el frío. Dos tandas de referencia y enfriado final se incluyen en el total; bandejas más pequeñas añaden tandas y tiempo. Puedes usar chocolate del mismo porcentaje en chispas o trocitos; chocolate con leche cambia la nutrición y los alérgenos. Cambiar mantequilla por aceite, harina integral o sin gluten o quitar huevo requiere reformular; no prometemos equivalencia. No pruebes harina, huevo ni masa crudos y limpia manos, superficies y utensilios después de manipularlos. Guarda las galletas completamente frías en recipiente limpio y hermético; consume en 3 días en un lugar fresco y seco como propuesta doméstica de calidad sin ensayo de conservación. Con calor o humedad, refrigera a 4 °C o menos. Para más tiempo, congela frías y bien envueltas hasta 1 mes como propuesta de calidad no verificada. Descarta toda la galleta si aparece moho. Contiene trigo/gluten, huevo y leche; revisa etiquetas de avena y chocolate por posibles trazas. Las cifras estimadas incluyen toda la fórmula y una unidad de veinte iguales.</p>"},{"id":"8e2ea7e1-25b6-5c81-bf7f-f5ee61c844cb","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"hafer-schokoladen-kekse","public_path":"/de/hafer-schokoladen-kekse","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade","excerpt":"Hausgemachte Kekse mit Haferflocken und Schokolade: abgewogene Zutaten, gekühlter Teig, zwei Backdurchgänge und geschätzte Nährwerte je Keks.","summary":"Kekse mit ganzen Haferflocken und dunklen Schokoladenstücken aus cremig gerührter Butter und gekühltem Teig. Vorgeschlagen sind 20 Stück und 118 Minuten einschließlich Temperieren, zwei Backdurchgängen und Abkühlen; Rezeptur und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche getestet.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Hausmannskost","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"ungesüßte Haferflocken, keine Instantflocken","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Zutaten und Schokolade"},{"name":"Weizenmehl, ohne zugesetztes Backtriebmittel","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Zutaten und Schokolade"},{"name":"ungesalzene Butter","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Cremige Mischung"},{"name":"brauner Zucker","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Cremige Mischung"},{"name":"weißer Kristallzucker","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Cremige Mischung"},{"name":"Vollei ohne Schale, abgewogen","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Cremige Mischung"},{"name":"Vanilleextrakt","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Cremige Mischung"},{"name":"doppelt wirkendes Backpulver","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Zutaten und Schokolade"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Zutaten und Schokolade"},{"name":"dunkle Schokolade mit 60–69 % Kakao, gehackt","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Trockene Zutaten und Schokolade"}],"steps":[{"title":"Butter temperieren und Utensilien vorbereiten","content":"Die 100 g ungesalzene Butter würfeln und etwa 20 Minuten bei Raumtemperatur stehen lassen, bis sie auf Druck nachgibt, ohne geschmolzen zu sein; bei Bedarf länger warten. Waage, zwei Schüsseln, Teigschaber, Rührgerät und zwei Metallbleche von etwa 40 ×30 cm mit Backpapier vorbereiten. Alle übrigen Zutaten abwiegen; die 50 g Ei werden ohne Schale gewogen und entsprechen nicht zwangsläufig einem ganzen Ei. Das Ei bis zur Zugabe gekühlt lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Butter temperieren und Utensilien vorbereiten"},{"title":"Butter mit beiden Zuckersorten verrühren","content":"Weiche Butter mit den 100 g braunem und den 40 g weißem Zucker etwa 2 Minuten cremig und gleichmäßig rühren. Boden und Schüsselwand abschaben, damit keine Butterwürfel bleiben. Butter nicht schmelzen und nicht versuchen, sämtliche Zuckerkristalle aufzulösen; die Masse darf noch etwas körnig sein.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Butter mit beiden Zuckersorten verrühren"},{"title":"Ei und Vanille zugeben","content":"Die 50 g Ei ohne Schale und die 4 g Vanilleextrakt zugeben. Etwa 1 Minute unterrühren und die Schüssel erneut abschaben. Wirkt die Mischung etwas getrennt, mit den trockenen Zutaten im nächsten Schritt fortfahren. Hände und Geräte nach Kontakt mit rohem Ei waschen; die Mischung nicht probieren.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Ei und Vanille zugeben"},{"title":"Mehl mischen und einarbeiten","content":"In der zweiten Schüssel die 120 g Mehl, die 4 g Backpulver und das 1 g Salz gleichmäßig mischen. Mit dem Teigschaber nur so lange unter die cremige Masse rühren, bis kein trockenes Mehl mehr sichtbar ist. Kein selbsttreibendes Mehl verwenden und nicht lange schlagen: der Teig soll dick und ohne Pulvernester sein.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Mehl mischen und einarbeiten"},{"title":"Haferflocken und Schokolade unterheben","content":"Die 150 g Haferflocken und die 100 g gehackte Schokolade mit dem Teigschaber vom Boden her gleichmäßig unterheben. Flocken ganz lassen und nicht mahlen. Der Teig ist fest und klebrig. Weder Milch noch Wasser zugeben und den rohen Teig mit ungegartem Mehl und Ei nicht probieren.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Haferflocken und Schokolade unterheben"},{"title":"Teig kühlen und Ofen vorheizen","content":"Die Schüssel abdecken und den Teig 30 Minuten bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen, damit er fester wird. Während der letzten 15 Minuten den Ofen auf 180 °C Ober-/Unterhitze mit mittlerer Schiene vorheizen. Das Vorheizen läuft gleichzeitig mit dem Kühlen und wird nicht erneut zum Gesamtzeitbedarf addiert. Die zweite Portion während des ersten Backdurchgangs gekühlt halten.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Teig kühlen und Ofen vorheizen"},{"title":"Zwanzig gleich große Portionen formen","content":"Den gesamten Teig in 20 gleich große Portionen von etwa 33–34 g teilen; vor dem Backen wiegen die Zutaten zusammen 669 g. Kugeln formen und leicht zu Scheiben von etwa 4 cm Durchmesser und 1 cm Dicke drücken. Je 10 auf jedes kalte Blech legen, mit etwa 5 cm Abstand zwischen den Rändern. Passt die Anordnung nicht auf das Blech, weitere Durchgänge einplanen und die Gesamtzeit verlängern.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Zwanzig gleich große Portionen formen"},{"title":"Ein Blech nach dem anderen backen","content":"Das erste Blech mittig bei 180 °C als Richtwert 14 Minuten backen; ab 12 Minuten prüfen und je nach Ofen etwa 12–16 einplanen. Die Ränder sollen goldbraun und die Mitte gesetzt sein, ohne feucht glänzenden rohen Teig; ein noch etwas biegsamer Kern wird beim Abkühlen fester. Falls nötig, weitere 2 Minuten backen und erneut prüfen. Mit trockenen Ofenhandschuhen herausnehmen und das zweite Blech ebenso backen. Beide Richtwert-Durchgänge ergeben 28 Minuten Backzeit.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Ein Blech nach dem anderen backen"},{"title":"Auf einem Gitter abkühlen lassen und kalt lagern","content":"Jeden Durchgang 5 Minuten auf dem Blech lassen und dann mit einem Heber für weitere etwa 15 Minuten auf ein Gitter setzen. Das erste Blech kühlt während des zweiten Backdurchgangs; nach der letzten Portion werden 20 Minuten Abkühlzeit gezählt. Vorgeschlagene Gesamtzeit: 118 Minuten, nämlich 20 zum Temperieren +20 aktive Vorbereitung +30 Kühlen +28 Backen +20 abschließendes Abkühlen. Ein Keks ist eine Portion; vorgeschlagen sind 20 Stück, ohne gemessenes Endgewicht.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: Auf einem Gitter abkühlen lassen und kalt lagern"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"ungesüßte Haferflocken, keine Instantflocken","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Weizenmehl, ohne zugesetztes Backtriebmittel","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ungesalzene Butter","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"brauner Zucker","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"weißer Kristallzucker","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vollei ohne Schale, abgewogen","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Vanilleextrakt","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"doppelt wirkendes Backpulver","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"dunkle Schokolade mit 60–69 % Kakao, gehackt","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Ein Keks von zwanzig vorgeschlagenen gleichen Stücken; kein gemessenes Endgewicht","method":"Die Grammmenge jeder der zehn Zutaten mit ihrem USDA-Wert je 100 g multiplizieren, summieren und durch 20 teilen. Alle Butter, Zucker, Eier, Haferflocken und Schokolade sind enthalten; keine erfundenen Nährstoffverluste beim Backen.","note":"Zutatenbasierte Schätzung, keine Analyse oder Küchenprüfung. Unangereicherte trockene Haferflocken und angereichertes ungebleichtes Weißmehl sind Referenzdatensätze. Schokolade mit 60–69 % und doppelt wirkendes Backpulver können je nach Marke bei Zucker und Natrium abweichen. Bei anderer Ausbeute neu teilen. Alle acht Nährstoffe sind in sämtlichen zehn Datensätzen vorhanden; fehlende Angaben werden nicht als null behandelt."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Goldbraune Haferkekse mit sichtbaren Flocken und dunklen Schokoladenstücken auf einem Gitter, ohne Glasur"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["Haferkekse mit Schokolade","Haferflockenkekse","Kekse mit dunkler Schokolade","hausgemachte Kekse"],"notes":"Originale, ungetestete Rezeptur: Mengen, Ausbeute von 20 Stück, Konsistenz und Zeiten müssen noch bestätigt werden. Ungesüßte Haferflocken, gewöhnliches Mehl und weiche, nicht geschmolzene Butter verwenden. Bei noch harter Butter die 20 Minuten Temperieren verlängern; Vorheizen und Kühlen überschneiden sich. Zwei Backdurchgänge und abschließendes Abkühlen sind enthalten; kleinere Bleche benötigen weitere Durchgänge und mehr Zeit. Schokolade gleichen Kakaogehalts kann gehackt oder als Stückchen verwendet werden; Milchschokolade verändert Nährwerte und Allergene. Öl statt Butter, Vollkorn- oder glutenfreies Mehl sowie Weglassen des Eis verlangen eine neue Rezeptur und sind nicht als gleichwertig bestätigt. Rohes Mehl, Ei und Teig nicht probieren; Hände, Flächen und Geräte danach reinigen. Vollständig kalte Kekse in einem sauberen luftdichten Behälter aufbewahren und als ungetesteten häuslichen Qualitätsvorschlag an einem kühlen trockenen Ort innerhalb von 3 Tagen essen. Bei Wärme oder Feuchtigkeit bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Kalt gut verpackt bis zu 1 Monat einfrieren ist ein unbestätigter Qualitätsvorschlag. Bei Schimmel den ganzen Keks entsorgen. Enthält Weizen/Gluten, Ei und Milch; Hafer- und Schokoladenetiketten auf Spuren prüfen. Nährwerte umfassen die gesamte Rezeptur und einen von zwanzig gleichen Keksen.","seo":{"title":"Haferkekse mit Schokolade Schritt für Schritt","description":"Haferkekse mit dunkler Schokolade: abgewogene Zutaten, gekühlter Teig, Backen in zwei Durchgängen und geschätzte Nährwerte je Keks.","image_alt":"Goldbraune Haferkekse mit sichtbaren Flocken und dunklen Schokoladenstücken auf einem Gitter, ohne Glasur","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Welche Haferflocken und Schokolade brauche ich?","a":"150 g ungesüßte Haferflocken statt gezuckerter Instantprodukte und 100 g dunkle Schokolade mit 60–69 % Kakao verwenden. Flocken ganz lassen. Andere Kakaogehalte oder fertige Frühstücksmischungen verändern Rezeptur und Nährwerte."},{"q":"Warum den Teig kühlen?","a":"30 Minuten bei höchstens 4 °C festigen die Butter und erleichtern das Formen von 20 gleichen Scheiben. Kühlung nicht auslassen und keine geschmolzene Butter verwenden. Das zweite Blech gekühlt halten und rohen Teig nicht probieren."},{"q":"Wie lange dauert es und wie lagere ich die Kekse?","a":"Vorgeschlagen sind 118 Minuten: 20 Temperieren, 20 Vorbereitung, 30 Kühlen, 28 Backen in zwei Durchgängen und 20 abschließendes Abkühlen. Jeden Durchgang ab 12 Minuten bei 180 °C kontrollieren. Vollständig kalt lagern und als ungetesteten Vorschlag innerhalb von 3 Tagen essen; bei Wärme oder Feuchtigkeit bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen."}]},"content_html":"<p>Kekse mit ganzen Haferflocken und dunklen Schokoladenstücken aus cremig gerührter Butter und gekühltem Teig. Vorgeschlagen sind 20 Stück und 118 Minuten einschließlich Temperieren, zwei Backdurchgängen und Abkühlen; Rezeptur und Ausbeute sind noch nicht in der Küche getestet.</p><p>Originale, ungetestete Rezeptur: Mengen, Ausbeute von 20 Stück, Konsistenz und Zeiten müssen noch bestätigt werden. Ungesüßte Haferflocken, gewöhnliches Mehl und weiche, nicht geschmolzene Butter verwenden. Bei noch harter Butter die 20 Minuten Temperieren verlängern; Vorheizen und Kühlen überschneiden sich. Zwei Backdurchgänge und abschließendes Abkühlen sind enthalten; kleinere Bleche benötigen weitere Durchgänge und mehr Zeit. Schokolade gleichen Kakaogehalts kann gehackt oder als Stückchen verwendet werden; Milchschokolade verändert Nährwerte und Allergene. Öl statt Butter, Vollkorn- oder glutenfreies Mehl sowie Weglassen des Eis verlangen eine neue Rezeptur und sind nicht als gleichwertig bestätigt. Rohes Mehl, Ei und Teig nicht probieren; Hände, Flächen und Geräte danach reinigen. Vollständig kalte Kekse in einem sauberen luftdichten Behälter aufbewahren und als ungetesteten häuslichen Qualitätsvorschlag an einem kühlen trockenen Ort innerhalb von 3 Tagen essen. Bei Wärme oder Feuchtigkeit bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Kalt gut verpackt bis zu 1 Monat einfrieren ist ein unbestätigter Qualitätsvorschlag. Bei Schimmel den ganzen Keks entsorgen. Enthält Weizen/Gluten, Ei und Milch; Hafer- und Schokoladenetiketten auf Spuren prüfen. Nährwerte umfassen die gesamte Rezeptur und einen von zwanzig gleichen Keksen.</p>"},{"id":"2953f081-e7ae-53d7-ae08-8536c6b43cc1","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"oatmeal-and-chocolate-cookies","public_path":"/en/oatmeal-and-chocolate-cookies","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/oatmeal-and-chocolate-cookies/","language":"en","title":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies","excerpt":"Homemade oat and chocolate cookies with weighed ingredients, chilled dough, two baking batches and estimated nutrition per cookie.","summary":"Cookies with whole rolled oats and dark chocolate chunks, made from creamed butter and chilled dough. The proposed yield is 20 cookies in 118 minutes including butter softening, two baking batches and cooling; the formula and yield await kitchen testing.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Home cooking","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"unsweetened rolled oats, not instant oats","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Dry ingredients and chocolate"},{"name":"plain all-purpose wheat flour, not self-rising","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Dry ingredients and chocolate"},{"name":"unsalted butter","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Creamed mixture"},{"name":"brown sugar","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Creamed mixture"},{"name":"white granulated sugar","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Creamed mixture"},{"name":"whole egg without shell, weighed","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Creamed mixture"},{"name":"vanilla extract","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Creamed mixture"},{"name":"double-acting baking powder","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Dry ingredients and chocolate"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Dry ingredients and chocolate"},{"name":"dark chocolate, 60–69 % cacao, chopped","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Dry ingredients and chocolate"}],"steps":[{"title":"Soften the butter and prepare the equipment","content":"Dice the 100 g unsalted butter and leave it at room temperature for about 20 minutes until it yields to pressure without melting; allow longer if it stays hard. Prepare scales, two bowls, a spatula, a beater and two metal baking trays roughly 40 ×30 cm lined with baking parchment. Weigh the remaining ingredients; the 50 g egg is weighed without its shell and does not necessarily equal one whole egg. Keep the egg chilled until adding it.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Soften the butter and prepare the equipment"},{"title":"Cream the butter with both sugars","content":"Beat the soft butter with the 100 g brown sugar and the 40 g white sugar for about 2 minutes until uniformly creamy. Scrape the bottom and sides so no butter cubes remain. Do not melt the butter or try to dissolve every sugar crystal; a slightly grainy texture is fine.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Cream the butter with both sugars"},{"title":"Add the egg and vanilla","content":"Add the 50 g shell-free egg and the 4 g vanilla extract. Beat for approximately 1 minute until combined, scraping the bowl again. If the mixture looks slightly separated, continue with the dry ingredients in the next step. Wash hands and equipment that touched raw egg; do not taste this mixture.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Add the egg and vanilla"},{"title":"Mix and incorporate the flour","content":"In the second bowl, mix the 120 g flour, the 4 g baking powder and the 1 g salt evenly. Add these dry ingredients to the creamed mixture and stir with a spatula just until no flour remains visible. Do not use self-rising flour or beat for a long time: the dough should be thick with no pockets of powder.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Mix and incorporate the flour"},{"title":"Fold in the oats and chocolate","content":"Add the 150 g rolled oats and the 100 g chopped chocolate. Fold up from the bottom with the spatula to distribute them; keep the oats in whole flakes rather than grinding them. The dough is firm and sticky. Do not add milk or water, and do not taste the raw dough because it contains uncooked flour and egg.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Fold in the oats and chocolate"},{"title":"Chill the dough and preheat the oven","content":"Cover the bowl and refrigerate the dough for 30 minutes at 4 °C or below to firm it up. During the final 15 minutes of chilling, preheat the oven to 180 °C conventional heat with a middle rack. Preheating overlaps chilling and is not added again to the total time. Keep the second batch refrigerated while the first one bakes.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Chill the dough and preheat the oven"},{"title":"Shape twenty equal portions","content":"Divide all the dough into 20 equal portions of about 33–34 g; the ingredients total 669 g before cooking. Form balls and gently flatten into discs about 4 cm across and 1 cm thick. Put 10 on each cold tray, leaving about 5 cm between their edges. If this arrangement does not fit your tray, use more batches and extend the total time.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Shape twenty equal portions"},{"title":"Bake one tray at a time","content":"Bake the first tray on the middle rack at 180 °C for 14 minutes as a reference; start checking at 12 and expect about 12–16 depending on the oven. The edges should be golden and the centers set, without shiny wet raw dough; slightly flexible centers firm as they cool. If more cooking is needed, add 2 minutes and check again. Remove with dry oven gloves and bake the second tray the same way. The two reference batches total 28 minutes in the oven.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Bake one tray at a time"},{"title":"Cool on a rack and store only when cold","content":"Leave each batch on its tray for 5 minutes, then use a spatula to transfer it to a rack for about 15 more minutes. The first batch cools while the second one bakes; count 20 minutes after the last batch. The proposed total is 118 minutes: 20 for butter softening +20 active preparation +30 chilling +28 baking +20 final cooling. Serve one cookie per portion, with a proposed yield of 20 and no measured finished weight.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Oatmeal and dark chocolate cookies: Cool on a rack and store only when cold"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"unsweetened rolled oats, not instant oats","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"plain all-purpose wheat flour, not self-rising","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"unsalted butter","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"brown sugar","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"white granulated sugar","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"whole egg without shell, weighed","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vanilla extract","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"double-acting baking powder","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"dark chocolate, 60–69 % cacao, chopped","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"One of twenty equal proposed cookies; no measured finished weight","method":"Sum the grams of each of the ten ingredients multiplied by its USDA value per 100 g, then divide by 20. All butter, sugar, egg, oats and chocolate are included; no nutrient losses during baking are invented.","note":"Ingredient-based estimate, not an analysis or kitchen trial. Regular unfortified dry oats model rolled oats; enriched unbleached white flour models plain flour. Chocolate with 60–69 % cacao and double-acting baking powder can vary by brand, especially sugar and sodium. Adjust to the actual yield if it differs. All eight nutrients are present in all ten records; missing values are never filled with zero."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Golden oatmeal cookies with visible flakes and dark chocolate chunks on a cooling rack, without icing"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["oatmeal chocolate cookies","rolled oat cookies","dark chocolate cookies","homemade cookies"],"notes":"Original proposed formula with no kitchen trial: quantities, yield of 20, texture and timing await confirmation. Use plain rolled oats, all-purpose flour and soft butter that has not melted. Extend the 20 minutes of softening if the butter remains hard; preheating overlaps chilling. Two reference baking batches and final cooling are included; smaller trays add batches and time. Chocolate chips or chunks with the same cacao percentage can be used; milk chocolate changes nutrition and allergens. Replacing butter with oil, using wholegrain or gluten-free flour or omitting egg requires reformulation; no equivalent result is promised. Never taste raw flour, egg or dough, and clean hands, surfaces and equipment after handling them. Store completely cold cookies in a clean airtight container and eat within 3 days in a cool dry place as an untested home quality suggestion. In heat or humidity, refrigerate at 4 °C or below. Freeze cold, well-wrapped cookies for up to 1 month as an unverified quality suggestion. Discard the entire cookie if mold appears. Contains wheat/gluten, egg and milk; check oat and chocolate labels for traces. Estimated figures include the whole formula and one of twenty equal cookies.","seo":{"title":"Oatmeal chocolate cookies, step by step","description":"Make cookies with rolled oats and dark chocolate: weighed ingredients, chilled dough, baking in batches and estimated nutrition per cookie.","image_alt":"Golden oatmeal cookies with visible flakes and dark chocolate chunks on a cooling rack, without icing","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Which oats and chocolate should I use?","a":"Use 150 g plain rolled oats, not sweetened instant oats, and 100 g dark chocolate with 60–69 % cacao. Keep the flakes whole. Another chocolate percentage or prepared cereal mix changes the formula and nutrition."},{"q":"Why must I chill the dough?","a":"The 30 minutes at 4 °C or below help firm the butter and make shaping 20 equal discs easier. Do not skip chilling or use melted butter. Keep the second tray chilled and never taste raw dough."},{"q":"How long do they take and how should I store them?","a":"The proposed total is 118 minutes: 20 softening, 20 preparation, 30 chilling, 28 baking in two batches and 20 final cooling. Start checking each batch at 12 minutes at 180 °C. Store completely cold and eat within 3 days as an untested suggestion; in heat or humidity refrigerate at 4 °C or below."}]},"content_html":"<p>Cookies with whole rolled oats and dark chocolate chunks, made from creamed butter and chilled dough. The proposed yield is 20 cookies in 118 minutes including butter softening, two baking batches and cooling; the formula and yield await kitchen testing.</p><p>Original proposed formula with no kitchen trial: quantities, yield of 20, texture and timing await confirmation. Use plain rolled oats, all-purpose flour and soft butter that has not melted. Extend the 20 minutes of softening if the butter remains hard; preheating overlaps chilling. Two reference baking batches and final cooling are included; smaller trays add batches and time. Chocolate chips or chunks with the same cacao percentage can be used; milk chocolate changes nutrition and allergens. Replacing butter with oil, using wholegrain or gluten-free flour or omitting egg requires reformulation; no equivalent result is promised. Never taste raw flour, egg or dough, and clean hands, surfaces and equipment after handling them. Store completely cold cookies in a clean airtight container and eat within 3 days in a cool dry place as an untested home quality suggestion. In heat or humidity, refrigerate at 4 °C or below. Freeze cold, well-wrapped cookies for up to 1 month as an unverified quality suggestion. Discard the entire cookie if mold appears. Contains wheat/gluten, egg and milk; check oat and chocolate labels for traces. Estimated figures include the whole formula and one of twenty equal cookies.</p>"},{"id":"888c601f-b419-56a9-9d3e-a8e7b9732a63","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"biscuits-avoine-chocolat","public_path":"/fr/biscuits-avoine-chocolat","source_url":null,"language":"fr","title":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir","excerpt":"Biscuits maison aux flocons d’avoine et au chocolat : ingrédients pesés, pâte réfrigérée, deux fournées et nutrition estimée par biscuit.","summary":"Biscuits aux flocons d’avoine entiers et aux morceaux de chocolat noir, préparés avec du beurre travaillé en crème et une pâte réfrigérée. La proposition donne 20 biscuits en 118 minutes, avec assouplissement du beurre, deux fournées et refroidissement ; formule et rendement restent à tester en cuisine.","category":"Desserts","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Dessert","cuisine":"Familiale","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"flocons d’avoine sans sucre, non instantanés","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Ingrédients secs et chocolat"},{"name":"farine de blé ordinaire, sans levure incorporée","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Ingrédients secs et chocolat"},{"name":"beurre doux","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mélange crémeux"},{"name":"sucre roux","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mélange crémeux"},{"name":"sucre blanc cristallisé","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Mélange crémeux"},{"name":"œuf entier sans coquille, pesé","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mélange crémeux"},{"name":"extrait de vanille","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Mélange crémeux"},{"name":"levure chimique à double action","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Ingrédients secs et chocolat"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Ingrédients secs et chocolat"},{"name":"chocolat noir à 60–69 %, en morceaux","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Ingrédients secs et chocolat"}],"steps":[{"title":"Assouplissez le beurre et préparez le matériel","content":"Coupez les 100 g de beurre doux en dés et laissez-les environ 20 minutes à température ambiante, jusqu’à ce qu’ils cèdent sous la pression sans fondre ; prolongez si nécessaire. Préparez une balance, deux bols, une spatule, un batteur et deux plaques métalliques d’environ 40 ×30 cm couvertes de papier cuisson. Pesez les autres ingrédients ; les 50 g d’œuf se pèsent sans coquille et ne correspondent pas forcément à un œuf entier. Gardez l’œuf au froid jusqu’à son incorporation.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Assouplissez le beurre et préparez le matériel"},{"title":"Travaillez le beurre avec les deux sucres","content":"Battez le beurre souple avec les 100 g de sucre roux et les 40 g de sucre blanc pendant environ 2 minutes, pour obtenir une crème uniforme. Raclez le fond et les parois afin d’éliminer les dés de beurre. Ne faites pas fondre le beurre et ne cherchez pas à dissoudre tous les grains de sucre ; le mélange peut rester légèrement granuleux.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Travaillez le beurre avec les deux sucres"},{"title":"Ajoutez l’œuf et la vanille","content":"Incorporez les 50 g d’œuf sans coquille et les 4 g d’extrait de vanille. Battez environ 1 minute et raclez à nouveau le bol. Si le mélange paraît un peu séparé, poursuivez avec les ingrédients secs à l’étape suivante. Lavez mains et ustensiles ayant touché l’œuf cru ; ne goûtez pas ce mélange.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Ajoutez l’œuf et la vanille"},{"title":"Mélangez et incorporez la farine","content":"Dans le second bol, mélangez uniformément les 120 g de farine, les 4 g de levure chimique et le 1 g de sel. Ajoutez ces ingrédients à la crème et remuez à la spatule juste jusqu’à disparition de la farine visible. N’utilisez pas de farine avec levure et ne battez pas longtemps : la pâte doit être épaisse, sans poches de poudre.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Mélangez et incorporez la farine"},{"title":"Incorporez les flocons et le chocolat","content":"Ajoutez les 150 g de flocons d’avoine et les 100 g de chocolat coupé. Mélangez à la spatule en remontant du fond pour les répartir ; gardez les flocons entiers, sans les broyer. La pâte est ferme et collante. N’ajoutez ni lait ni eau et ne goûtez pas la pâte crue contenant farine et œuf non cuits.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Incorporez les flocons et le chocolat"},{"title":"Réfrigérez la pâte et préchauffez le four","content":"Couvrez le bol et réfrigérez la pâte 30 minutes à 4 °C maximum pour la raffermir. Pendant les dernières 15 minutes, préchauffez le four à 180 °C en chaleur traditionnelle, grille au milieu. Préchauffage et réfrigération se chevauchent ; ne comptez pas le préchauffage une seconde fois. Gardez la seconde fournée au froid pendant la cuisson de la première.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Réfrigérez la pâte et préchauffez le four"},{"title":"Formez vingt portions identiques","content":"Divisez toute la pâte en 20 portions identiques d’environ 33–34 g ; les ingrédients totalisent 669 g avant cuisson. Formez des boules puis aplatissez-les légèrement en disques d’environ 4 cm de diamètre et 1 cm d’épaisseur. Disposez-en 10 sur chaque plaque froide, avec environ 5 cm entre leurs bords. Si cela ne tient pas sur votre plaque, faites davantage de fournées et prolongez le temps total.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Formez vingt portions identiques"},{"title":"Cuisez une plaque à la fois","content":"Cuisez la première plaque au milieu à 180 °C pendant 14 minutes à titre indicatif ; contrôlez dès 12 minutes et prévoyez environ 12–16 selon le four. Les bords doivent être dorés et le centre pris, sans pâte humide brillante ; un centre encore un peu souple se raffermit au refroidissement. Si nécessaire, ajoutez 2 minutes et vérifiez de nouveau. Sortez avec des gants secs puis cuisez la seconde plaque de la même façon. Les deux fournées de référence totalisent 28 minutes au four.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Cuisez une plaque à la fois"},{"title":"Laissez refroidir sur une grille avant de ranger","content":"Laissez chaque fournée 5 minutes sur sa plaque puis transférez les biscuits à la spatule sur une grille pour environ 15 minutes supplémentaires. Le refroidissement de la première fournée se déroule pendant la seconde cuisson ; comptez 20 minutes après la dernière fournée. Le total proposé est de 118 minutes : 20 pour assouplir le beurre +20 de préparation active +30 au froid +28 de cuisson +20 de refroidissement final. Une portion correspond à un biscuit ; rendement proposé de 20, sans poids final mesuré.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Biscuits à l’avoine et au chocolat noir: Laissez refroidir sur une grille avant de ranger"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"flocons d’avoine sans sucre, non instantanés","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farine de blé ordinaire, sans levure incorporée","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"beurre doux","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sucre roux","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sucre blanc cristallisé","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"œuf entier sans coquille, pesé","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"extrait de vanille","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"levure chimique à double action","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"chocolat noir à 60–69 %, en morceaux","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un biscuit sur vingt portions identiques proposées ; sans poids final mesuré","method":"Multipliez les grammes de chacun des dix ingrédients par sa valeur USDA pour 100 g, additionnez puis divisez par 20. Tout le beurre, sucre, œuf, avoine et chocolat est inclus ; aucune perte de nutriments à la cuisson n’est inventée.","note":"Estimation par ingrédients, pas une analyse ni un essai en cuisine. Avoine sèche régulière non enrichie et farine blanche enrichie non blanchie servent de références. Chocolat à 60–69 % et levure à double action varient selon la marque, surtout sucre et sodium. Adaptez au rendement réel. Les huit nutriments sont présents dans les dix fiches ; aucune absence n’est remplacée par zéro."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Biscuits dorés aux flocons d’avoine visibles et aux morceaux de chocolat noir sur une grille, sans glaçage"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["biscuits avoine chocolat","biscuits aux flocons d’avoine","biscuits chocolat noir","biscuits maison"],"notes":"Formule originale proposée, sans essai de cuisine : quantités, rendement de 20 biscuits, texture et temps restent à confirmer. Utilisez des flocons nature, une farine ordinaire et du beurre souple non fondu. Prolongez les 20 minutes si le beurre reste dur ; le préchauffage chevauche le refroidissement de la pâte. Deux fournées et le refroidissement final sont inclus ; des plaques plus petites ajoutent des fournées et du temps. Pépites ou morceaux de même pourcentage de cacao conviennent ; le chocolat au lait modifie nutrition et allergènes. Remplacer le beurre par de l’huile, utiliser une farine complète ou sans gluten ou supprimer l’œuf impose une nouvelle formule ; aucune équivalence n’est promise. Ne goûtez pas farine, œuf ou pâte crus ; nettoyez mains, surfaces et ustensiles après manipulation. Rangez les biscuits totalement froids dans une boîte propre hermétique et consommez-les en 3 jours dans un endroit frais et sec, proposition domestique de qualité non testée. Par chaleur ou humidité, réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum. Congelez-les froids et bien emballés jusqu’à 1 mois, proposition de qualité non vérifiée. En présence de moisissure, jetez le biscuit entier. Contient blé/gluten, œuf et lait ; vérifiez les traces sur les étiquettes d’avoine et de chocolat. Les valeurs estimées incluent toute la formule et un biscuit sur vingt identiques.","seo":{"title":"Biscuits avoine-chocolat, étape par étape","description":"Préparez des biscuits aux flocons d’avoine et au chocolat noir : ingrédients pesés, pâte froide, cuisson par fournées et nutrition estimée par biscuit.","image_alt":"Biscuits dorés aux flocons d’avoine visibles et aux morceaux de chocolat noir sur une grille, sans glaçage","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Quels flocons et quel chocolat utiliser ?","a":"Prenez 150 g de flocons d’avoine nature, sans préparation instantanée sucrée, et 100 g de chocolat noir à 60–69 %. Gardez les flocons entiers. Un autre pourcentage ou des céréales préparées modifient formule et nutrition."},{"q":"Pourquoi refroidir la pâte ?","a":"Les 30 minutes à 4 °C maximum raffermissent le beurre et facilitent la formation de 20 disques identiques. Ne supprimez pas ce repos et n’utilisez pas de beurre fondu. Gardez la seconde plaque au froid et ne goûtez pas la pâte crue."},{"q":"Combien de temps prévoir et comment conserver ?","a":"La proposition est de 118 minutes : 20 pour assouplir, 20 de préparation, 30 au froid, 28 pour deux fournées et 20 de refroidissement final. Vérifiez chaque fournée dès 12 minutes à 180 °C. Rangez totalement froid et consommez en 3 jours, proposition non testée ; par chaleur ou humidité, réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum."}]},"content_html":"<p>Biscuits aux flocons d’avoine entiers et aux morceaux de chocolat noir, préparés avec du beurre travaillé en crème et une pâte réfrigérée. La proposition donne 20 biscuits en 118 minutes, avec assouplissement du beurre, deux fournées et refroidissement ; formule et rendement restent à tester en cuisine.</p><p>Formule originale proposée, sans essai de cuisine : quantités, rendement de 20 biscuits, texture et temps restent à confirmer. Utilisez des flocons nature, une farine ordinaire et du beurre souple non fondu. Prolongez les 20 minutes si le beurre reste dur ; le préchauffage chevauche le refroidissement de la pâte. Deux fournées et le refroidissement final sont inclus ; des plaques plus petites ajoutent des fournées et du temps. Pépites ou morceaux de même pourcentage de cacao conviennent ; le chocolat au lait modifie nutrition et allergènes. Remplacer le beurre par de l’huile, utiliser une farine complète ou sans gluten ou supprimer l’œuf impose une nouvelle formule ; aucune équivalence n’est promise. Ne goûtez pas farine, œuf ou pâte crus ; nettoyez mains, surfaces et ustensiles après manipulation. Rangez les biscuits totalement froids dans une boîte propre hermétique et consommez-les en 3 jours dans un endroit frais et sec, proposition domestique de qualité non testée. Par chaleur ou humidité, réfrigérez à 4 °C maximum. Congelez-les froids et bien emballés jusqu’à 1 mois, proposition de qualité non vérifiée. En présence de moisissure, jetez le biscuit entier. Contient blé/gluten, œuf et lait ; vérifiez les traces sur les étiquettes d’avoine et de chocolat. Les valeurs estimées incluent toute la formule et un biscuit sur vingt identiques.</p>"},{"id":"9cd42615-1613-5b98-a890-d3a2940817bb","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"biscotti-di-avena-e-cioccolato","public_path":"/it/biscotti-di-avena-e-cioccolato","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/biscotti-di-avena-e-cioccolato/","language":"it","title":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente","excerpt":"Biscotti casalinghi con fiocchi d’avena e cioccolato: ingredienti pesati, impasto refrigerato, due infornate e nutrienti stimati per biscotto.","summary":"Biscotti con fiocchi d’avena interi e pezzetti di cioccolato fondente, preparati con burro lavorato a crema e impasto freddo. Si propongono 20 biscotti e 118 minuti compresi ammorbidimento del burro, due infornate e raffreddamento; formula e resa attendono una prova in cucina.","category":"Dolci","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Dolce","cuisine":"Casalinga","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"fiocchi d’avena senza zucchero, non istantanei","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Ingredienti secchi e cioccolato"},{"name":"farina di frumento comune, non autolievitante","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Ingredienti secchi e cioccolato"},{"name":"burro non salato","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Composto cremoso"},{"name":"zucchero di canna","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Composto cremoso"},{"name":"zucchero bianco semolato","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Composto cremoso"},{"name":"uovo intero senza guscio, pesato","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Composto cremoso"},{"name":"estratto di vaniglia","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Composto cremoso"},{"name":"lievito per dolci a doppia azione","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Ingredienti secchi e cioccolato"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Ingredienti secchi e cioccolato"},{"name":"cioccolato fondente 60–69 %, a pezzetti","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Ingredienti secchi e cioccolato"}],"steps":[{"title":"Ammorbidisci il burro e prepara gli utensili","content":"Taglia i 100 g di burro non salato a cubetti e lasciali circa 20 minuti a temperatura ambiente, finché cedono alla pressione senza fondersi; se sono ancora duri, prolunga il tempo. Prepara bilancia, due ciotole, spatola, sbattitore e due teglie metalliche di circa 40 ×30 cm con carta forno. Pesa gli altri ingredienti; i 50 g di uovo si pesano senza guscio e non equivalgono necessariamente a un uovo intero. Tieni l’uovo al freddo fino all’aggiunta.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Ammorbidisci il burro e prepara gli utensili"},{"title":"Lavora il burro con i due zuccheri","content":"Sbatti il burro morbido con i 100 g di zucchero di canna e i 40 g di zucchero bianco per circa 2 minuti, fino a una crema uniforme. Raschia fondo e pareti eliminando i cubetti di burro. Non sciogliere il burro e non cercare di dissolvere ogni granello di zucchero; il composto può restare leggermente granuloso.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Lavora il burro con i due zuccheri"},{"title":"Aggiungi uovo e vaniglia","content":"Incorpora i 50 g di uovo senza guscio e i 4 g di estratto di vaniglia. Sbatti circa 1 minuto e raschia nuovamente la ciotola. Se il composto sembra leggermente separato, prosegui con gli ingredienti secchi al passo seguente. Lava mani e utensili che hanno toccato uovo crudo; non assaggiare il composto.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Aggiungi uovo e vaniglia"},{"title":"Mescola e incorpora la farina","content":"Nella seconda ciotola distribuisci uniformemente i 120 g di farina, i 4 g di lievito e il 1 g di sale. Uniscili alla crema e mescola con la spatola solo fino alla scomparsa della farina visibile. Non usare farina autolievitante e non sbattere a lungo: l’impasto deve essere denso, senza sacche di polvere.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Mescola e incorpora la farina"},{"title":"Unisci fiocchi e cioccolato","content":"Aggiungi i 150 g di fiocchi d’avena e i 100 g di cioccolato a pezzetti. Mescola dal fondo con la spatola per distribuirli; lascia i fiocchi interi senza tritarli. L’impasto è consistente e appiccicoso. Non aggiungere latte o acqua e non assaggiare l’impasto crudo, che contiene farina e uovo non cotti.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Unisci fiocchi e cioccolato"},{"title":"Raffredda l’impasto e preriscalda il forno","content":"Copri la ciotola e refrigera l’impasto per 30 minuti a 4 °C o meno, per rassodarlo. Negli ultimi 15 minuti preriscalda il forno statico a 180 °C con ripiano centrale. Il preriscaldamento coincide con il raffreddamento e non si aggiunge di nuovo al tempo totale. Tieni la seconda infornata in frigorifero mentre cuoce la prima.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Raffredda l’impasto e preriscalda il forno"},{"title":"Forma venti porzioni uguali","content":"Dividi tutto l’impasto in 20 porzioni uguali di circa 33–34 g; gli ingredienti pesano complessivamente 669 g prima della cottura. Forma palline e schiacciale leggermente in dischi di circa 4 cm di diametro e 1 cm di spessore. Mettine 10 su ogni teglia fredda, lasciando circa 5 cm tra i bordi. Se la disposizione non entra nella teglia, usa più infornate e prolunga il tempo totale.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Forma venti porzioni uguali"},{"title":"Cuoci una teglia alla volta","content":"Cuoci la prima teglia al centro a 180 °C per 14 minuti come riferimento; controlla da 12 e prevedi circa 12–16 secondo il forno. I bordi devono essere dorati e il centro assestato, senza impasto umido lucido; un centro ancora un po’ flessibile si rassoda raffreddandosi. Se serve, aggiungi 2 minuti e controlla di nuovo. Estrai con guanti asciutti e cuoci la seconda teglia allo stesso modo. Le due infornate di riferimento sommano 28 minuti in forno.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Cuoci una teglia alla volta"},{"title":"Raffredda sulla griglia e conserva solo da freddi","content":"Lascia ogni infornata 5 minuti nella teglia, poi trasferisci i biscotti con una spatola sulla griglia per circa altri 15 minuti. La prima infornata si raffredda durante la seconda cottura; si contano 20 minuti dopo l’ultima. Il totale proposto è 118 minuti: 20 per ammorbidire +20 di preparazione attiva +30 di frigorifero +28 di forno +20 di raffreddamento finale. Servi un biscotto per porzione; resa proposta di 20, senza peso finale misurato.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Biscotti di avena e cioccolato fondente: Raffredda sulla griglia e conserva solo da freddi"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"fiocchi d’avena senza zucchero, non istantanei","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farina di frumento comune, non autolievitante","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"burro non salato","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"zucchero di canna","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"zucchero bianco semolato","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"uovo intero senza guscio, pesato","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"estratto di vaniglia","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"lievito per dolci a doppia azione","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cioccolato fondente 60–69 %, a pezzetti","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un biscotto di venti porzioni uguali proposte; senza peso finale misurato","method":"Somma i grammi di ciascuno dei dieci ingredienti moltiplicati per il valore USDA per 100 g e dividi per 20. Tutto il burro, zucchero, uovo, avena e cioccolato è incluso; non si inventano perdite di nutrienti in forno.","note":"Stima per ingredienti, non analisi né prova in cucina. Avena secca regolare non fortificata e farina bianca arricchita non sbiancata sono riferimenti. Cioccolato 60–69 % e lievito a doppia azione variano per marca, soprattutto zucchero e sodio. Adegua alla resa effettiva. Tutti gli otto nutrienti sono presenti nelle dieci schede; i dati mancanti non sono sostituiti con zero."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Biscotti dorati con fiocchi d’avena visibili e pezzetti di cioccolato fondente su una griglia, senza glassa"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["biscotti avena cioccolato","biscotti ai fiocchi d’avena","biscotti al cioccolato fondente","biscotti fatti in casa"],"notes":"Formula originale proposta senza prova in cucina: quantità, resa di 20 biscotti, consistenza e tempi attendono conferma. Usa fiocchi naturali, farina comune e burro morbido non fuso. Prolunga i 20 minuti se il burro rimane duro; preriscaldamento e frigorifero si sovrappongono. Sono incluse due infornate e il raffreddamento finale; teglie più piccole richiedono altre infornate e tempo. Si possono usare gocce o pezzetti con la stessa percentuale di cacao; il cioccolato al latte modifica nutrienti e allergeni. Sostituire burro con olio, usare farine integrali o senza glutine o eliminare l’uovo richiede riformulare, senza equivalenza garantita. Non assaggiare farina, uovo o impasto crudi; pulisci mani, superfici e utensili dopo averli manipolati. Conserva i biscotti completamente freddi in un contenitore pulito ermetico e consumali entro 3 giorni in luogo fresco asciutto, proposta domestica di qualità non sperimentata. Con caldo o umidità, refrigera a 4 °C o meno. Congela da freddi e ben avvolti fino a 1 mese come proposta di qualità non verificata. In caso di muffa scarta l’intero biscotto. Contiene frumento/glutine, uovo e latte; controlla possibili tracce sulle etichette di avena e cioccolato. I valori stimati includono tutta la formula e uno di venti biscotti uguali.","seo":{"title":"Biscotti avena e cioccolato passo per passo","description":"Prepara biscotti con fiocchi d’avena e cioccolato fondente: ingredienti pesati, impasto freddo, cottura in due infornate e nutrienti stimati.","image_alt":"Biscotti dorati con fiocchi d’avena visibili e pezzetti di cioccolato fondente su una griglia, senza glassa","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Quali fiocchi e cioccolato servono?","a":"Usa 150 g di fiocchi d’avena naturali, non preparati istantanei zuccherati, e 100 g di cioccolato fondente 60–69 %. Mantieni i fiocchi interi. Altre percentuali o cereali preparati cambiano formula e nutrienti."},{"q":"Perché raffreddare l’impasto?","a":"I 30 minuti a 4 °C o meno rassodano il burro e facilitano formare 20 dischi uguali. Non saltare il riposo e non usare burro fuso. Mantieni la seconda teglia in frigorifero e non assaggiare impasto crudo."},{"q":"Quanto tempo occorre e come conservarli?","a":"Si propongono 118 minuti: 20 per ammorbidire, 20 di preparazione, 30 di freddo, 28 per due infornate e 20 di raffreddamento finale. Controlla ogni infornata da 12 minuti a 180 °C. Conserva da completamente freddi e consuma in 3 giorni come proposta non testata; con caldo o umidità, refrigera a 4 °C o meno."}]},"content_html":"<p>Biscotti con fiocchi d’avena interi e pezzetti di cioccolato fondente, preparati con burro lavorato a crema e impasto freddo. Si propongono 20 biscotti e 118 minuti compresi ammorbidimento del burro, due infornate e raffreddamento; formula e resa attendono una prova in cucina.</p><p>Formula originale proposta senza prova in cucina: quantità, resa di 20 biscotti, consistenza e tempi attendono conferma. Usa fiocchi naturali, farina comune e burro morbido non fuso. Prolunga i 20 minuti se il burro rimane duro; preriscaldamento e frigorifero si sovrappongono. Sono incluse due infornate e il raffreddamento finale; teglie più piccole richiedono altre infornate e tempo. Si possono usare gocce o pezzetti con la stessa percentuale di cacao; il cioccolato al latte modifica nutrienti e allergeni. Sostituire burro con olio, usare farine integrali o senza glutine o eliminare l’uovo richiede riformulare, senza equivalenza garantita. Non assaggiare farina, uovo o impasto crudi; pulisci mani, superfici e utensili dopo averli manipolati. Conserva i biscotti completamente freddi in un contenitore pulito ermetico e consumali entro 3 giorni in luogo fresco asciutto, proposta domestica di qualità non sperimentata. Con caldo o umidità, refrigera a 4 °C o meno. Congela da freddi e ben avvolti fino a 1 mese come proposta di qualità non verificata. In caso di muffa scarta l’intero biscotto. Contiene frumento/glutine, uovo e latte; controlla possibili tracce sulle etichette di avena e cioccolato. I valori stimati includono tutta la formula e uno di venti biscotti uguali.</p>"},{"id":"5687e0ec-86bb-5f2e-9e4a-602b513662ef","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"オートミールチョコクッキー","public_path":"/ja/オートミールチョコクッキー","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー","excerpt":"材料を計量し、生地を冷やして2回に分けて焼く自家製オートミールチョコクッキー。1枚当たりの栄養は材料からの推定値です。","summary":"粒の形を残したオートミールとダークチョコレートを使い、クリーム状にしたバターと冷やした生地で作るクッキーです。提案の出来上がりは20枚、所要時間118分で、バターを柔らかくする時間、2回の焼成、冷ます時間を含みます。配合と出来上がり量は調理試作で未確認です。","category":"デザート","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"簡単","course":"デザート","cuisine":"家庭料理","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"無糖のロールドオーツ、インスタントタイプ以外","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"粉類とチョコレート"},{"name":"薄力系の小麦粉、膨張剤を含まないもの","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"粉類とチョコレート"},{"name":"無塩バター","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"クリーム状の材料"},{"name":"ブラウンシュガー","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"クリーム状の材料"},{"name":"白いグラニュー糖","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"クリーム状の材料"},{"name":"殻を除いて計量した全卵","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"クリーム状の材料"},{"name":"バニラエキストラクト","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"クリーム状の材料"},{"name":"二段階作用のベーキングパウダー","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"粉類とチョコレート"},{"name":"細粒塩","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"粉類とチョコレート"},{"name":"カカオ60–69 %のダークチョコレート、刻む","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"粉類とチョコレート"}],"steps":[{"title":"バターを柔らかくし、道具を用意する","content":"無塩バター100 gを角切りにし、室温に約20分置きます。溶けずに指で押すとへこむ柔らかさが目安で、まだ硬ければ時間を延ばします。はかり、ボウル二個、へら、泡立て器、約40 ×30 cmの金属製天板二枚を用意し、オーブンシートを敷きます。残りの材料も量ります。卵50 gは殻を除いた重さで、必ずしも卵丸ごと一個とは限りません。加えるまで卵は冷蔵します。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: バターを柔らかくし、道具を用意する"},{"title":"バターと2種類の砂糖を混ぜる","content":"柔らかいバターにブラウンシュガー100 gと白砂糖40 gを加え、約2分混ぜて均一なクリーム状にします。ボウルの底と側面をこそげ、バターの塊を残さないようにします。バターを溶かしたり、砂糖の粒をすべて溶かそうとしたりせず、少しざらついていても構いません。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: バターと2種類の砂糖を混ぜる"},{"title":"卵とバニラを加える","content":"殻を除いた卵50 gとバニラエキストラクト4 gを加えます。約1分混ぜ、もう一度ボウルをこそげます。少し分離して見えても、次の手順で粉類を加えて進めます。生卵に触れた手と道具を洗い、この段階の生地は味見しません。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 卵とバニラを加える"},{"title":"粉類を混ぜて加える","content":"もう一方のボウルで小麦粉120 g、ベーキングパウダー4 g、塩1 gを均一に混ぜます。クリーム状の材料に加え、白い粉が見えなくなるまでへらで混ぜます。膨張剤入りの粉は使わず、長く泡立てません。粉の塊がない、濃い生地にします。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 粉類を混ぜて加える"},{"title":"オーツとチョコレートを混ぜ込む","content":"ロールドオーツ150 gと刻んだチョコレート100 gを加え、底からへらで返して均一に混ぜます。オーツは粒の形を残し、粉砕しません。生地はしっかりして粘りがあります。牛乳や水は加えず、未加熱の粉と卵を含む生地を味見しません。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: オーツとチョコレートを混ぜ込む"},{"title":"生地を冷やし、オーブンを予熱する","content":"ボウルを覆い、4 °C以下で30分冷蔵して生地を締めます。最後の15分の間に、上下加熱のオーブンを180 °Cに予熱し、網を中央に置きます。予熱は冷蔵時間と重なるため、総時間にもう一度加えません。最初の分を焼いている間、次の分は冷蔵しておきます。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 生地を冷やし、オーブンを予熱する"},{"title":"均等な20枚分に成形する","content":"全生地を約33–34 gずつ、均等な20個に分けます。加熱前の材料合計は669 gです。丸めて軽く押し、直径約4 cm、厚さ1 cmの円盤状にします。冷たい天板それぞれに10個ずつ置き、端と端の間を約5 cm空けます。天板に収まらなければ焼く回数を増やし、総時間も延ばします。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 均等な20枚分に成形する"},{"title":"天板を1枚ずつ焼く","content":"最初の天板を中央で180 °C、目安14分焼きます。12分から確認し、オーブンにより約12–16分を見込みます。縁がきつね色で中央が落ち着き、濡れた生地の光沢がない状態にします。出したとき中央が少ししなやかでも、冷めると締まります。加熱不足なら2分追加して再確認します。乾いたミトンで取り出し、次の天板も同様に焼きます。目安の二回分を合わせて焼成28分です。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 天板を1枚ずつ焼く"},{"title":"網で冷まし、冷めてから保存する","content":"各回とも天板に5分置き、その後へらで網へ移して、さらに約15分冷まします。最初の分は次の焼成中に冷めるため、最後の焼成後に20分を数えます。提案の総時間は118分で、バターを柔らかくする20分＋手を動かす準備20分＋冷蔵30分＋焼成28分＋最後の冷却20分です。一枚を一人分とし、提案の出来上がりは20枚。出来上がり重量は実測していません。","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"オートミールとダークチョコレートのクッキー: 網で冷まし、冷めてから保存する"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"無糖のロールドオーツ、インスタントタイプ以外","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"薄力系の小麦粉、膨張剤を含まないもの","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"無塩バター","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ブラウンシュガー","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"白いグラニュー糖","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"殻を除いて計量した全卵","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"バニラエキストラクト","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"二段階作用のベーキングパウダー","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"細粒塩","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"カカオ60–69 %のダークチョコレート、刻む","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"均等な20枚とする提案のうち1枚。出来上がり重量は未実測","method":"10材料それぞれのグラム数にUSDAの100 g当たりの値を掛けて合計し、20で割ります。バター、砂糖、卵、オーツ、チョコをすべて含み、焼成時の栄養損失は仮定しません。","note":"材料からの推定で、分析や調理試験ではありません。非強化の乾燥オーツと、強化された未漂白の白い小麦粉を参照しています。カカオ60–69 %のチョコと二段階作用の膨張剤は、特に糖とナトリウムが製品によって異なります。実際の枚数が変わったら割り直してください。8栄養項目は10件すべてにあり、欠測をゼロにしていません。"},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"網に並ぶ、オーツの粒とダークチョコのかけらが見えるきつね色のクッキー。アイシングなし"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["オートミールチョコクッキー","ロールドオーツクッキー","ダークチョコクッキー","自家製クッキー"],"notes":"独自の提案配合で、調理試作はしていません。20枚分の数量、食感、時間は確認待ちです。無糖のロールドオーツ、膨張剤なしの小麦粉、溶かしていない柔らかいバターを使います。バターが硬い場合は20分の室温時間を延ばします。予熱は冷蔵と重なります。2回の焼成と最後の冷却を含み、小さい天板なら回数と時間が増えます。同じカカオ割合のチョコチップや刻みチョコに変更できますが、ミルクチョコは栄養とアレルゲンが変わります。油への置き換え、全粒粉やグルテンフリー粉、卵の省略には配合の見直しが必要で、同じ結果は保証しません。生の粉、卵、生地を味見せず、作業後に手、台、道具を洗います。完全に冷めてから清潔な密閉容器に入れ、涼しく乾燥した場所で3日以内に食べることを、保存試験をしていない家庭用の品質目安として提案します。暑い場合や湿度が高い場合は4 °C以下で冷蔵します。冷めた状態でしっかり包んで1か月まで冷凍するのも、未検証の品質目安です。カビが出たらクッキー全体を捨てます。小麦／グルテン、卵、乳を含み、オーツとチョコの表示で微量混入も確認してください。栄養値は全配合を均等な20枚に分けたうちの1枚分です。","seo":{"title":"オートミールチョコクッキーの作り方","description":"オーツとダークチョコで作るクッキー。材料の計量、生地の冷蔵、2回の焼成まで具体的に説明し、1枚当たりの推定栄養も掲載。","image_alt":"網に並ぶ、オーツの粒とダークチョコのかけらが見えるきつね色のクッキー。アイシングなし","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"どのオーツとチョコを使いますか？","a":"無糖のロールドオーツ150 gと、カカオ60–69 %のダークチョコ100 gを使います。甘いインスタント製品は使わず、オーツは粒を残します。割合の異なるチョコや調製済みシリアルでは配合と栄養が変わります。"},{"q":"なぜ生地を冷やしますか？","a":"4 °C以下で30分冷やすとバターが締まり、均等な20枚分に成形しやすくなります。冷蔵を省略したり、溶かしバターを使ったりしません。次の天板は冷蔵し、生地を味見しないでください。"},{"q":"時間と保存方法は？","a":"提案は118分です。室温20分、準備20分、冷蔵30分、2回の焼成28分、最後の冷却20分を含みます。各回180 °Cで12分から確認します。完全に冷めてから保存し、未試験の目安として3日以内に食べます。暑い場合や湿度が高い場合は4 °C以下で冷蔵します。"}]},"content_html":"<p>粒の形を残したオートミールとダークチョコレートを使い、クリーム状にしたバターと冷やした生地で作るクッキーです。提案の出来上がりは20枚、所要時間118分で、バターを柔らかくする時間、2回の焼成、冷ます時間を含みます。配合と出来上がり量は調理試作で未確認です。</p><p>独自の提案配合で、調理試作はしていません。20枚分の数量、食感、時間は確認待ちです。無糖のロールドオーツ、膨張剤なしの小麦粉、溶かしていない柔らかいバターを使います。バターが硬い場合は20分の室温時間を延ばします。予熱は冷蔵と重なります。2回の焼成と最後の冷却を含み、小さい天板なら回数と時間が増えます。同じカカオ割合のチョコチップや刻みチョコに変更できますが、ミルクチョコは栄養とアレルゲンが変わります。油への置き換え、全粒粉やグルテンフリー粉、卵の省略には配合の見直しが必要で、同じ結果は保証しません。生の粉、卵、生地を味見せず、作業後に手、台、道具を洗います。完全に冷めてから清潔な密閉容器に入れ、涼しく乾燥した場所で3日以内に食べることを、保存試験をしていない家庭用の品質目安として提案します。暑い場合や湿度が高い場合は4 °C以下で冷蔵します。冷めた状態でしっかり包んで1か月まで冷凍するのも、未検証の品質目安です。カビが出たらクッキー全体を捨てます。小麦／グルテン、卵、乳を含み、オーツとチョコの表示で微量混入も確認してください。栄養値は全配合を均等な20枚に分けたうちの1枚分です。</p>"},{"id":"4c29aa1c-4d89-5232-9ec6-51caa027a87e","recipe_group_id":"936136e4-9267-4869-ad7b-eaa3a16a103f","slug":"biscoitos-de-aveia-e-chocolate","public_path":"/pt/biscoitos-de-aveia-e-chocolate","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo","excerpt":"Biscoitos caseiros com aveia em flocos e chocolate: ingredientes pesados, massa refrigerada, duas fornadas e nutrientes estimados por unidade.","summary":"Biscoitos com flocos inteiros de aveia e pedaços de chocolate amargo, feitos com manteiga batida e massa refrigerada. A proposta rende 20 unidades em 118 minutos, incluindo amolecer a manteiga, duas fornadas e esfriar; fórmula e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.","category":"Sobremesas","category_slug":"postres","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Sobremesa","cuisine":"Caseira","prep_time_minutes":20,"cook_time_minutes":28,"total_time_minutes":118,"servings":20,"ingredients":[{"name":"aveia em flocos sem açúcar, não instantânea","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Ingredientes secos e chocolate"},{"name":"farinha de trigo comum, sem fermento","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Ingredientes secos e chocolate"},{"name":"manteiga sem sal","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mistura cremosa"},{"name":"açúcar mascavo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Mistura cremosa"},{"name":"açúcar branco granulado","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Mistura cremosa"},{"name":"ovo inteiro sem casca, pesado","amount":"50","unit":"g","group":"Mistura cremosa"},{"name":"extrato de baunilha","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Mistura cremosa"},{"name":"fermento químico de dupla ação","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Ingredientes secos e chocolate"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"1","unit":"g","group":"Ingredientes secos e chocolate"},{"name":"chocolate amargo 60–69 %, picado","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Ingredientes secos e chocolate"}],"steps":[{"title":"Amoleça a manteiga e prepare os utensílios","content":"Corte os 100 g de manteiga sem sal em cubos e deixe cerca de 20 minutos em temperatura ambiente, até ceder à pressão sem derreter; se ainda estiver dura, espere mais. Prepare balança, duas tigelas, espátula, batedor e duas assadeiras metálicas de aproximadamente 40 ×30 cm com papel-manteiga próprio para forno. Pese os demais ingredientes; os 50 g de ovo são pesados sem casca e não correspondem necessariamente a um ovo inteiro. Mantenha o ovo refrigerado até adicionar.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Amoleça a manteiga e prepare os utensílios"},{"title":"Bata a manteiga com os dois açúcares","content":"Bata a manteiga macia com os 100 g de açúcar mascavo e os 40 g de açúcar branco por cerca de 2 minutos, até obter um creme uniforme. Raspe o fundo e as laterais para não deixar cubos de manteiga. Não derreta a manteiga nem tente dissolver todos os grãos de açúcar; a mistura pode continuar levemente granulosa.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Bata a manteiga com os dois açúcares"},{"title":"Adicione o ovo e a baunilha","content":"Incorpore os 50 g de ovo sem casca e os 4 g de extrato de baunilha. Bata aproximadamente 1 minuto e raspe novamente a tigela. Se a mistura parecer um pouco separada, continue com os secos na próxima etapa. Lave mãos e utensílios que tocaram ovo cru; não prove esta mistura.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Adicione o ovo e a baunilha"},{"title":"Misture e incorpore a farinha","content":"Na segunda tigela, misture uniformemente os 120 g de farinha, os 4 g de fermento e o 1 g de sal. Adicione ao creme e mexa com a espátula somente até desaparecer a farinha visível. Não use farinha com fermento nem bata por muito tempo: a massa deve ficar espessa, sem bolsões de pó.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Misture e incorpore a farinha"},{"title":"Junte os flocos e o chocolate","content":"Adicione os 150 g de aveia em flocos e os 100 g de chocolate picado. Misture com a espátula, trazendo a massa do fundo, para distribuir; mantenha os flocos inteiros, sem triturar. A massa fica firme e pegajosa. Não adicione leite ou água e não prove a massa crua, pois contém farinha e ovo sem cozinhar.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Junte os flocos e o chocolate"},{"title":"Refrigere a massa e preaqueça o forno","content":"Tampe a tigela e refrigere a massa por 30 minutos a 4 °C ou menos, para firmar. Nos últimos 15 minutos, preaqueça o forno a 180 °C com calor em cima e embaixo e grade central. O preaquecimento coincide com a refrigeração e não entra novamente no tempo total. Mantenha a segunda fornada na geladeira enquanto assa a primeira.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Refrigere a massa e preaqueça o forno"},{"title":"Modele vinte porções iguais","content":"Divida toda a massa em 20 porções iguais de aproximadamente 33–34 g; os ingredientes somam 669 g antes de assar. Faça bolas e achate levemente em discos de cerca de 4 cm de diâmetro e 1 cm de espessura. Coloque 10 em cada assadeira fria, deixando aproximadamente 5 cm entre as bordas. Se não couberem na sua assadeira, faça mais fornadas e aumente o tempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Modele vinte porções iguais"},{"title":"Asse uma assadeira de cada vez","content":"Asse a primeira assadeira no centro a 180 °C por 14 minutos como referência; confira a partir de 12 e preveja cerca de 12–16 conforme o forno. As bordas devem estar douradas e o centro assentado, sem massa úmida brilhante; um centro ainda levemente flexível fica firme ao esfriar. Se necessário, adicione 2 minutos e confira novamente. Retire com luvas secas e asse a segunda assadeira do mesmo jeito. As duas fornadas de referência somam 28 minutos de forno.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Asse uma assadeira de cada vez"},{"title":"Esfrie em uma grade e guarde somente frios","content":"Deixe cada fornada 5 minutos na assadeira e transfira com espátula para uma grade por aproximadamente mais 15 minutos. A primeira esfria durante o segundo assamento; conte 20 minutos depois da última fornada. O total proposto é 118 minutos: 20 para amolecer +20 de preparo ativo +30 de geladeira +28 de forno +20 de resfriamento final. Sirva um biscoito por porção, com rendimento proposto de 20 e sem peso final medido.","image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","image_alt":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate amargo: Esfrie em uma grade e guarde somente frios"}],"nutrition":{"calories":146.1,"protein_g":2.3,"carbs_g":19.3,"fat_g":6.8,"saturated_fat_g":3.8,"fiber_g":1.3,"sugar_g":8.8,"sodium_mg":42,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"aveia em flocos sem açúcar, não instantânea","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":173904,"fdc_description":"Cereals, oats, regular and quick, not fortified, dry","per_100g":{"calories":379,"protein_g":13.2,"carbs_g":67.7,"fat_g":6.52,"saturated_fat_g":1.11,"fiber_g":10.1,"sugar_g":0.99,"sodium_mg":6},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173904/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"farinha de trigo comum, sem fermento","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":168936,"fdc_description":"Wheat flour, white, all-purpose, enriched, unbleached","per_100g":{"calories":364,"protein_g":10.3,"carbs_g":76.3,"fat_g":0.98,"saturated_fat_g":0.155,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":0.27,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168936/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"manteiga sem sal","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":173430,"fdc_description":"Butter, without salt","per_100g":{"calories":717,"protein_g":0.85,"carbs_g":0.06,"fat_g":81.1,"saturated_fat_g":50.5,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.06,"sodium_mg":11},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173430/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"açúcar mascavo","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":168833,"fdc_description":"Sugars, brown","per_100g":{"calories":380,"protein_g":0.12,"carbs_g":98.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":97,"sodium_mg":28},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168833/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"açúcar branco granulado","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"calories":387,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":100,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":99.8,"sodium_mg":1},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ovo inteiro sem casca, pesado","edible_grams":50,"fdc_id":171287,"fdc_description":"Egg, whole, raw, fresh","per_100g":{"calories":143,"protein_g":12.6,"carbs_g":0.72,"fat_g":9.51,"saturated_fat_g":3.13,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0.37,"sodium_mg":142},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"extrato de baunilha","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173471,"fdc_description":"Vanilla extract","per_100g":{"calories":288,"protein_g":0.06,"carbs_g":12.6,"fat_g":0.06,"saturated_fat_g":0.01,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":12.6,"sodium_mg":9},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173471/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fermento químico de dupla ação","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":172804,"fdc_description":"Leavening agents, baking powder, double-acting, straight phosphate","per_100g":{"calories":51,"protein_g":0.1,"carbs_g":24.1,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0.2,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":7890},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172804/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":1,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"chocolate amargo 60–69 %, picado","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170272,"fdc_description":"Chocolate, dark, 60-69% cacao solids","per_100g":{"calories":579,"protein_g":6.12,"carbs_g":52.4,"fat_g":38.3,"saturated_fat_g":22,"fiber_g":8,"sugar_g":36.7,"sodium_mg":10},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170272/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Um biscoito de vinte unidades iguais propostas; sem peso final medido","method":"Some os gramas de cada um dos dez ingredientes multiplicados pelo valor USDA por 100 g e divida por 20. Toda a manteiga, açúcar, ovo, aveia e chocolate está incluída; não se inventam perdas de nutrientes no forno.","note":"Estimativa por ingredientes, não análise nem teste de cozinha. Aveia seca regular não fortificada e farinha branca enriquecida não branqueada são referências. Chocolate 60–69 % e fermento de dupla ação podem variar por marca, sobretudo açúcar e sódio. Ajuste ao rendimento real. Os oito nutrientes constam nas dez fichas; nenhuma ausência é preenchida com zero."},"image_url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada.webp","alt":"Biscoitos dourados de aveia com flocos visíveis e pedaços de chocolate amargo sobre uma grade, sem cobertura"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["biscoitos de aveia e chocolate","biscoitos de aveia em flocos","biscoitos de chocolate amargo","biscoitos caseiros"],"notes":"Fórmula original proposta, sem teste de cozinha: quantidades, rendimento de 20 unidades, textura e tempos aguardam confirmação. Use aveia natural em flocos, farinha comum e manteiga macia sem derreter. Amplie os 20 minutos se a manteiga continuar dura; preaquecimento e refrigeração se sobrepõem. Duas fornadas e o resfriamento final estão incluídos; assadeiras menores acrescentam fornadas e tempo. Gotas ou pedaços de chocolate do mesmo percentual de cacau podem ser usados; chocolate ao leite muda nutrientes e alergênicos. Trocar manteiga por óleo, usar farinha integral ou sem glúten ou retirar o ovo exige reformular; não há equivalência prometida. Não prove farinha, ovo ou massa crus e limpe mãos, superfícies e utensílios depois de manipular. Guarde totalmente frios em recipiente limpo hermético e consuma em 3 dias em local fresco e seco, como proposta doméstica de qualidade sem teste de conservação. Com calor ou umidade, refrigere a 4 °C ou menos. Congele frios e bem embalados por até 1 mês como proposta de qualidade não verificada. Descarte o biscoito inteiro se aparecer mofo. Contém trigo/glúten, ovo e leite; confira rótulos de aveia e chocolate quanto a traços. Os valores estimados incluem toda a fórmula e uma unidade de vinte iguais.","seo":{"title":"Biscoitos de aveia e chocolate passo a passo","description":"Prepare biscoitos de aveia em flocos e chocolate amargo: ingredientes pesados, massa fria, duas fornadas e nutrientes estimados por unidade.","image_alt":"Biscoitos dourados de aveia com flocos visíveis e pedaços de chocolate amargo sobre uma grade, sem cobertura","image_variants":["/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/galletas-de-avena-y-chocolate/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Qual aveia e chocolate usar?","a":"Use 150 g de aveia natural em flocos, não preparada instantânea açucarada, e 100 g de chocolate amargo 60–69 %. Mantenha os flocos inteiros. Outro percentual ou cereais preparados mudam fórmula e nutrientes."},{"q":"Por que refrigerar a massa?","a":"Os 30 minutos a 4 °C ou menos firmam a manteiga e facilitam modelar 20 discos iguais. Não pule o frio nem use manteiga derretida. Mantenha a segunda assadeira refrigerada e não prove massa crua."},{"q":"Quanto tempo leva e como conservar?","a":"São propostos 118 minutos: 20 para amolecer, 20 de preparo, 30 de frio, 28 para duas fornadas e 20 de resfriamento final. Confira cada fornada a partir de 12 minutos a 180 °C. Guarde totalmente frios e consuma em 3 dias como proposta sem teste; com calor ou umidade, refrigere a 4 °C ou menos."}]},"content_html":"<p>Biscoitos com flocos inteiros de aveia e pedaços de chocolate amargo, feitos com manteiga batida e massa refrigerada. A proposta rende 20 unidades em 118 minutos, incluindo amolecer a manteiga, duas fornadas e esfriar; fórmula e rendimento aguardam teste de cozinha.</p><p>Fórmula original proposta, sem teste de cozinha: quantidades, rendimento de 20 unidades, textura e tempos aguardam confirmação. Use aveia natural em flocos, farinha comum e manteiga macia sem derreter. Amplie os 20 minutos se a manteiga continuar dura; preaquecimento e refrigeração se sobrepõem. Duas fornadas e o resfriamento final estão incluídos; assadeiras menores acrescentam fornadas e tempo. Gotas ou pedaços de chocolate do mesmo percentual de cacau podem ser usados; chocolate ao leite muda nutrientes e alergênicos. Trocar manteiga por óleo, usar farinha integral ou sem glúten ou retirar o ovo exige reformular; não há equivalência prometida. Não prove farinha, ovo ou massa crus e limpe mãos, superfícies e utensílios depois de manipular. Guarde totalmente frios em recipiente limpo hermético e consuma em 3 dias em local fresco e seco, como proposta doméstica de qualidade sem teste de conservação. Com calor ou umidade, refrigere a 4 °C ou menos. Congele frios e bem embalados por até 1 mês como proposta de qualidade não verificada. Descarte o biscoito inteiro se aparecer mofo. Contém trigo/glúten, ovo e leite; confira rótulos de aveia e chocolate quanto a traços. Os valores estimados incluem toda a fórmula e uma unidade de vinte iguais.</p>"}]$records$::jsonb;
